{"sha": "5618254443607f3aae31b2747c5f403d258f354ac0796bb334d1622be9a2bbca", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:sqrt:simplify}", "化简 $\\sqrt{75}$：因为 $75 = 25 \\times 3$，", "\\[", "\\sqrt{75} = \\sqrt{25 \\times 3} = \\sqrt{25} \\times \\sqrt 3 = 5\\sqrt3 .", "\\]", "化简 $\\sqrt{72}$：因为 $72 = 36 \\times 2$，", "$\\sqrt{72} = 6\\sqrt2$。再看一个商：", "$\\sqrt{\\dfrac{49}{16}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{49}}{\\sqrt{16}} = \\dfrac74$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[根式的加法]\\label{ex:g9:sqrt:add}", "只有当各根式\\emph{同类}时，根式的和才能化简。", "计算 $\\sqrt{12} + \\sqrt{27} - \\sqrt{48}$，先化简每一项：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\sqrt{12} &= \\sqrt{4 \\times 3} = 2\\sqrt3, \\\\", "\\sqrt{27} &= \\sqrt{9 \\times 3} = 3\\sqrt3, \\\\", "\\sqrt{48} &= \\sqrt{16 \\times 3} = 4\\sqrt3,", "\\end{align*}", "于是和为 $2\\sqrt3 + 3\\sqrt3 - 4\\sqrt3 = (2 + 3 - 4)\\sqrt3 = \\sqrt3$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[根式的展开]\\label{ex:g9:sqrt:expand}", "代数中的恒等式同样适用于根式。展开", "$\\left(\\sqrt5 + 2\\right)^2$，用 $(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$：", "\\[", "\\left(\\sqrt5 + 2\\right)^2 = 5 + 2 \\times 2\\sqrt5 + 4 = 9 + 4\\sqrt5 .", "\\]", "再用第三个恒等式 $(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2$：", "\\[", "\\left(\\sqrt7 + \\sqrt3\\right)\\left(\\sqrt7 - \\sqrt3\\right) = 7 - 3 = 4 :", "\\]", "两个无理数的积可以是整数。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{方程 \\texorpdfstring{$x^2 = a$}{x2 = a}}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[解方程 $x^2 = a$]\\label{thm:g9:sqrt:equation}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $a > 0$，则方程 $x^2 = a$ 恰有两个解：", "        $\\sqrt a$ 和 $-\\sqrt a$；", "  \\item 若 $a = 0$，则唯一解为 $0$；", "  \\item 若 $a < 0$，则方程无解。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $x^2 = a$ 改写为 $x^2 - \\left(\\sqrt a\\right)^2 = 0$，", "在 $a \\geq 0$ 时，利用平方差公式分解因式：", "\\[", "\\left(x - \\sqrt a\\right)\\left(x + \\sqrt a\\right) = 0 ,", "\\]", "于是 $x = \\sqrt a$ 或 $x = -\\sqrt a$（$a = 0$ 时两者重合）。当", "$a < 0$ 时方程无解，因为 $x^2 \\geq 0 > a$ 对所有 $x$ 成立。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=7.6cm, height=5.4cm,", "  xmin=-3.1, xmax=3.1, ymin=-1.6, ymax=5.4,", "  xtick={-1.732,1.732}, xticklabels={$-\\sqrt3$,$\\sqrt3$},", "  ytick={3}, yticklabels={$3$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-2.25:2.25, samples=90] {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=-2.9:2.9] {3};", "  \\fill (axis cs:-1.732,3) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:1.732,3) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[dashed] (axis cs:-1.732,3) -- (axis cs:-1.732,0);", "  \\draw[dashed] (axis cs:1.732,3) -- (axis cs:1.732,0);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 求解 $x^2 = 3$，即抛物线 $y = x^2$ 与水平直线", "$y = 3$ 相交于横坐标为 $\\pm\\sqrt3$ 的两点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$x^2 = 16$：解为 $4$ 与 $-4$。\\quad", "$x^2 = 5$：解为 $\\sqrt5$ 与 $-\\sqrt5$（精确值；$\\sqrt5", "\\approx 2.236$）。\\quad", "$x^2 = -9$：无解。\\quad", "$3x^2 = 21$：先两边同除以 3，得 $x^2 = 7$，解为 $\\pm\\sqrt7$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:sqrt:1}", "不用计算器计算：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{64}, \\qquad \\sqrt{100}, \\qquad \\sqrt{0.09}, \\qquad", "\\sqrt{\\tfrac{1}{25}}, \\qquad \\left(\\sqrt{13}\\right)^2, \\qquad", "\\sqrt{(-4)^2} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:sqrt:2}", "化简：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{50}, \\qquad \\sqrt{45}, \\qquad \\sqrt{98}, \\qquad \\sqrt{300} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:sqrt:3}", "计算并化简：", "\\[", "\\sqrt2 \\times \\sqrt{18}, \\qquad", "\\frac{\\sqrt{75}}{\\sqrt3}, \\qquad", "\\sqrt5 \\times \\sqrt{20}, \\qquad", "\\frac{\\sqrt{8}}{\\sqrt{50}} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}